\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper ts-prose\">\n                    <p class=\"line-clamp-4 !text-sm !leading-7\">A walk from Materuni to the Kuringe waterfalls is perfect for those who want to experience Mount Kilimanjaro without actually climbing it! From Materuni a local guide takes you on a beautiful walk to the amazing 70-meter-high waterfall in a 40-minute walk. At 2,500 meters above sea level, the path leads through valleys and tropical […]</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <a class=\"mb-4 mt-6 lg:mb-0 btn btn-small btn-red xl:btn--stretched lg:btn-green !grow-0 overview-card-btn\" href=\"/activity/walk-from-materuni-village-to-kuringe-waterfall/\" data-id=\"14842\" id=\"js-excursions-toggle\">\n                View this activity            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</article>","14846":"<article class=\"relative flex flex-col isolate bg-sand md:mx-0 lg:flex-row\">\n    <div class=\"relative card-media lg:w-5/12 lg:shrink-0 overflow-hidden\">\n                    <img width=\"1024\" height=\"580\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/hot-springs-1024x580.jpg\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full bg-grey object-cover wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/hot-springs-1024x580.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/hot-springs-300x170.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/hot-springs-768x435.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/hot-springs-1536x870.jpg 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/hot-springs-60x34.jpg 60w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/hot-springs.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\">        \n        <!-- Wishlist button -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4\">\n            <a href=\"#\" title=\"Wishlist\" class=\"flex justify-center items-center w-10 h-10 text-2xl leading-none bg-white rounded-full transition-colors group text-anthracite\" data-wishlist-post-id=\"14846\" data-wishlist-post-type=\"excursions\">\n                <span cla